        <mxCell id="17a" value="&lt;b&gt;1. compute_statistics() — Mean per Posisi&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr&gt;3.136 posisi patch, masing-masing:&lt;br&gt;rata-rata 209 vektor dimensi [550]&lt;br&gt;hasil: &lt;b&gt;mean [550, 3136]&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8DAEF;strokeColor=#8E44AD;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
