        <mxCell id="18a" value="&lt;b&gt;1. build_feature_bank() — Stack Semua Patch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr&gt;209 images x 3.136 patch = &lt;b&gt;655.424 patch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;masing-masing vektor [550], total &lt;b&gt;[655424, 550]&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D4E6F1;strokeColor=#2E86C1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
